            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ Elisa ekalĩte nyũmbanĩ yake, na atumĩa mekalĩte nake; na mũsumbĩ atũma mũndũ kuma vala ũĩ: ĩndĩ mũtũmwa atanamba ũvika vala ũĩ, atavya atumĩa, Nĩmũkwona ũndũ mwana ũũ wa mũaani ũtũmĩte mũndũ avete mũtwe wakwa? Sisyai, yĩla mũtũmwa ũnũũka, vingai mũomo, na mũilũmya mũomo ndakalike: matuu ma maũũ ma vwana wake matiĩ ĩtina wake? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na o akĩneena nao, sisya, mũtũmwa atheea vala ũĩ: na asya, Sisya, ũthũku ũũ wumĩte kwa Yeova; nĩmweteelela Yeova ĩvinda yĩasanga kĩ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
